<http://data.silknow.org/object/22f28d32-367f-3ef0-b114-9811d872e96a>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "[Lance] with tinsel and gilded tinsel, silver wire and gilded silver wire wound on silk cores, gilded silver frise yarn and [brocaded] polychrome silks on a salmon-colored ground with chevron-like motifs in compound weave.  Symmnetrical design of scrolls and floral sprays.  Selvedge on both sides of six cords and a wide stripe.  Somewhat worn, a few holes.  [7/85 Photography: B/W, color slide]  Exhibition History: Dressed and Furnished in Flowers:  Fine Textiles of the Western European 18th Century (April 29-July 28, 1985) (MFA-Torf Gallery-Tuchscherer)."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/6224a8e2-3a29-3545-911d-dde5d44ca248> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "[Lance] with tinsel and gilded tinsel, silver wire and gilded silver wire wound on silk cores, gilded silver frise yarn and [brocaded] polychrome silks on a salmon-colored ground with chevron-like motifs in compound weave.  Symmnetrical design of scrolls and floral sprays.  Selvedge on both sides of six cords and a wide stripe.  Somewhat worn, a few holes.  [7/85 Photography: B/W, color slide]  Exhibition History: Dressed and Furnished in Flowers:  Fine Textiles of the Western European 18th Century (April 29-July 28, 1985) (MFA-Torf Gallery-Tuchscherer)."@en ;
